  "corrections": [
    "2026-10-08: dropped Series.dt.week / Series.dt.weekofyear (the combined .dt accessor still exposes them for period dtypes in 3.0.6) and resample(convention) (still accepted in 3.0.6); the environments are the authority",
    "2026-10-08: accessor members are keyed by accessor class; DatetimeProperties.week/weekofyear are real removals for datetime series, PeriodProperties.week is kept, which is what the combined accessor had masked",
    "2026-10-19: to_datetime(infer_datetime_format) gets the replacement to_datetime(format=\"ISO8601\") for strings that are all ISO 8601 but not identically formatted (2.0.0 notes, 'Datetimes are now parsed with a consistent format'); links pd-007's gold pair in validation step 7"
  ]
